   Interpreted:
     Python 3.x            Python 2.7 (legacy)
     Ruby 2.x, 3.x         Perl 5.x, 6.x
     PHP 7.x, 8.x          Lua 5.x, LuaJIT
     Tcl 8.x, 9.x          R 4.x
     Julia 1.x             Node.js (JavaScript/TypeScript)
     Deno                  Bun
