     Common Lisp (SBCL, CCL)
     Prolog (SWI, GNU)
     Smalltalk (Pharo, GNU)

   Compiled:
     C (gcc, clang, tcc)   C++ (g++, clang++)
     Rust (rustc, cargo)   Go (go)
     Zig                   Nim
     D (dmd, ldc, gdc)     Swift
     Objective-C           Ada (GNAT)
     Fortran (gfortran)    Pascal (fpc)
     Crystal               V (vlang)
     Odin                  Hare

   JVM:
     Java (javac, openjdk) Kotlin (kotlinc)
     Scala (scalac)        Groovy
     Clojure               JRuby
     Jython                Frege

   .NET / Mono:
     C# (dotnet, mono)     F#
     VB.NET                PowerShell (pwsh)

   Functional:
     Haskell (ghc, cabal, stack)
     OCaml (ocaml, dune, opam)
     Erlang (erlc, rebar3)
     Elixir (elixirc, mix)
     F# (dotnet, fsharp)
     Elm
     PureScript

   Scripting:
     Bash, Zsh, Fish, Ksh, Dash
     PowerShell (pwsh, pwsh-core)
     AWK (gawk, mawk, nawk)
     sed, ed
     VimScript, Neovim Lua
     Nushell, Oil, Elvish, Xonsh

   Systems / Assembly:
     x86, x86_64 (nasm, gas)
     ARM, ARM64 (gas, keil)
     RISC-V (gas, riscv-gcc)
     WASM (wat2wasm, wasm-pack)

   Data / Config:
     YAML, JSON, TOML (interpreter = jq/yq)
     SQL (sqlite3, psql, mysql)
     GraphQL
     Protocol Buffers
     Thrift, Avro

   Markup / Documentation:
     Markdown (pandoc, glow)
     LaTeX (pdflatex, xelatex)
     AsciiDoc
     reStructuredText
